flowchart TD
    Command["FINANCE / ADMIN export command"] --> Enqueue["Short transaction<br/>Approved snapshot + stable identity + durable job"]
    Enqueue --> Accepted["202 Accepted / QUEUED"]
    Enqueue --> Claim["Worker claim transaction<br/>SKIP LOCKED + lease + claim token"]
    Claim --> HTTP["SapTimesheetGateway<br/>HTTP call outside database transaction"]
    HTTP --> Result{"Outcome"}
    Result -->|Confirmed success| Success["SUCCEEDED + external reference"]
    Result -->|Permanent error| Failed["FAILED / safe diagnostic"]
    Result -->|Retryable, within budget| Retry["Bounded exponential backoff<br/>Same snapshot and identity"]
    Retry --> Claim
    Result -->|Ambiguous acceptance| Unknown["UNKNOWN"]
    Expired["Expired processing lease"] --> Unknown
    Unknown --> Lookup["Reconcile by stable identity<br/>No blind resend"]
    Lookup -->|Found| Success
    Lookup -->|Definitive miss, eligible| Retry
    Lookup -->|Still uncertain| Unknown
    Success --> Persist["Fenced result transaction<br/>Export + job + immutable attempt history"]
    Failed --> Persist
